---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Authors from '../components/Authors.astro';
import Film from '../components/Film.astro';
import { firstAuthor, otherPapers, patents } from '../data/papers';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
import { type Lang, L, lp } from '../i18n';

interface Props { lang: Lang }
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const zh = lang === 'zh';
const p = (href: string) => lp(lang, href);
const sep = zh ? '，' : ', ';
---
<Base lang={lang} title={zh ? '研究' : 'Research'} description={zh
  ? '孟海彬的研究：用毫米波 MIMO 雷达测量微米级的振动、声音和运动。论文、专利，以及它们背后的故事。'
  : "Haibin Meng's research: measuring micrometre vibration, sound and motion with mmWave MIMO radar. Papers, patents and the stories behind them."}>
  <h1>{zh ? '研究' : 'Research'}</h1>
  {zh ? (
    <>
      <p class="lead">雷达测的是距离，而回波的相位能测出远小于波长的距离变化。我用这一点去感知振动、声音和运动，全程不用接触。</p>
      <p>我是上海交通大学机械系统与振动全国重点实验室的博士生，导师是彭志科教授，日常和熊玉勇副教授一起工作。我的博士课题是用一台 MIMO 微波雷达测量多个方向的振动：雷达通常只能看到沿视线方向的运动，我想让它把其余方向也看清。</p>
    </>
  ) : (
    <>
      <p class="lead">A radar measures distance. Its phase measures distance changes far smaller than its wavelength. I use that to sense vibration, sound and motion without touching anything.</p>
      <p>I'm a PhD candidate in the State Key Laboratory of Mechanical System and Vibration at Shanghai Jiao Tong University, advised by Prof. Zhike Peng and working day to day with Assoc. Prof. Yuyong Xiong. My thesis is about measuring vibration in several dimensions with a single MIMO microwave radar: radar usually sees motion only along its line of sight, and I want it to see the rest.</p>
    </>
  )}
  <div class="links">
    <a href={SITE.scholar}>Google Scholar</a>
    <a href={SITE.orcid}>ORCID</a>
    <a href="#papers">{zh ? '论文' : 'Papers'}</a>
    <a href="#patents">{zh ? '专利' : 'Patents'}</a>
    <a href="#film">{zh ? '科普影片' : 'The film'}</a>
  </div>

  <h2 data-under>{zh ? '四个问题' : 'Four questions'}</h2>
  <p class="small">{zh ? '我以第一作者发表的论文，每篇都写成它回答的那个问题，再讲讲它是怎么走到今天的。' : 'My first-author papers, each told as the question it answers, and how it got there.'}</p>
  <ul class="list">
    {firstAuthor.map((x) => (
      <li data-icon={x.icon}>
        <span class="title">{L(lang, x.question)}</span>
        <p style="margin:6px 0">{L(lang, x.story)}</p>
        <span class="small"><a href={`https://doi.org/${x.doi}`} lang="en">{x.title}</a>. {x.venue}{sep}{x.year}.</span><br>
        <Authors authors={x.authors} me={x.me} />
      </li>
    ))}
  </ul>

  <h2 data-under>{zh ? '拒稿，然后接收' : 'Rejected, and then not'}</h2>
  {zh ? (
    <p>论文不会从想法直接走到发表，我觉得把这一点说出来有好处。多次反射那篇短文被拒了四次才被接收。横向位移那篇先被 IEEE T-MTT 拒稿，两周后又被 IEEE TAP 判为不在收稿范围，投到 MSSP 拿到拒稿重投，再改了两轮才被接收。每一轮都让论文变得更好：中继那篇在修改时补了三个实验，横向位移那篇的论证也更清楚了。我从中记住的是：给审稿人的回复，要和论文写得一样认真。</p>
  ) : (
    <p>Papers don't go straight from idea to print, and I think it helps to say so. The multiple-reflection letter was rejected four times before it was accepted. The cross-range paper was rejected by IEEE T-MTT, called out of scope by IEEE TAP two weeks later, given reject-and-resubmit by MSSP, and then accepted after two rounds of revision. Each round made it better: three new experiments for the relay paper, a sharper argument for the cross-range one. What I keep from it: write the reply to the reviewers as carefully as the paper.</p>
  )}

  <h2 data-under id="papers">{zh ? '全部论文' : 'All papers'}</h2>
  <p class="small">{zh ? '目前 12 篇：第一作者 4 篇，第二作者 3 篇。加下划线的是我的名字。论文标题保留英文原文。' : '12 so far: 4 as first author, 3 as second. My name is underlined.'}</p>
  <ul class="papers">
    {[...firstAuthor, ...otherPapers].sort((a, b) => b.year - a.year).map((x) => (
      <li>
        <a class="ptitle" href={`https://doi.org/${x.doi}`} lang="en">{x.title}</a>{x.award && <strong> · {L(lang, x.award)}</strong>}<br>
        <Authors authors={x.authors} me={x.me} /><br>
        <span class="small">{x.venue}{sep}{x.year}</span>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ul>

  <h2 data-under id="patents">{zh ? '专利' : 'Patents'}</h2>
  <ul class="list">
    {patents.map((x) => (
      <li data-icon="doc">
        {zh ? <span class="title">{x.zh}</span> : <span class="title">{x.title}</span>}
        {zh ? <span class="where" lang="en">{x.title}</span> : <span class="where" lang="zh-CN">{x.zh}</span>}
        <p style="margin:6px 0">{L(lang, x.note)}</p>
        <span class="small"><a href={x.href}>{x.id}</a>{sep}{L(lang, x.kind)}</span>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ul>

  <h2 data-under id="film">{zh ? '26 分钟讲清这个领域' : 'The field in 26 minutes'}</h2>
  {zh ? (
    <p>一部讲雷达怎样测振动的动画科普片，和编程智能体一起做的：为什么回波的相位是一把比头发丝还细的尺子，chirp 怎样按距离把回波分开，多根天线怎样带来方向，以及这个方法在哪里好用，在哪里吃力。影片是英文的。<a href={p('/projects/explainer-films/')}>这些影片是怎么做出来的</a>。</p>
  ) : (
    <p>An animated explainer of how a radar measures vibration, made with coding agents: why the phase of an echo is a ruler finer than a hair, how a chirp sorts echoes by distance, how many antennas add direction, and where the method works and where it struggles. <a href="/projects/explainer-films/">How the films are made</a>.</p>
  )}
  <Film lang={lang} />

  <h2 data-under>{zh ? '实验室里' : 'In the lab'}</h2>
  {zh ? (
    <>
      <p>雷达用的是 TI 的毫米波芯片，有 AR1243，有 AWR2243 的单片版和四片级联版，还有 IWR6843AOP，配 DCA1000 采集板，用 mmWave Studio 的脚本控制。参考数据来自激光位移传感器。此外还有电磁激振器、电动滑台、重力摆，从很小到很大的角反射器，以及很多 3D 打印的夹具。实验室用的 MATLAB 工具箱是<a href={p('/projects/radar-toolbox/')}>我写的</a>。</p>
      <p>做雷达之前，我做的是足式机器人：本科毕设是<a href={p('/projects/thesis-quadruped/')}>带机械臂的四足机器人全身协同规划</a>。我也给 IEEE Sensors Journal 审稿。</p>
    </>
  ) : (
    <>
      <p>TI mmWave radars (AR1243, AWR2243 single and 4-chip cascade, IWR6843AOP) with DCA1000 capture boards, scripted through mmWave Studio. A laser displacement sensor as the reference, an electrodynamic shaker, a motorised slide table, a gravity pendulum, corner reflectors from tiny to large, and many 3D-printed fixtures. The lab's MATLAB toolbox is <a href="/projects/radar-toolbox/">mine</a>.</p>
      <p>Before radar I worked on legged robots: <a href="/projects/thesis-quadruped/">whole-body planning for a quadruped with an arm</a>, my undergraduate thesis. I also review for the IEEE Sensors Journal.</p>
    </>
  )}
</Base>
